  "expr": ["+",["+",["*",["/",45,["-",["^",100,0.75],["^",10,0.75]]],["^",["actor","灵巧"],0.75]],["-",5,["*",["/",45,["-",["^",100,0.75],["^",10,0.75]]],["^",10,0.75]]]],["+",["*",["/",45,["-",["^",5,0.75],["^",1,0.75]]],["^",["talentLevel"],0.75]],["-",5,["*",["/",45,["-",["^",5,0.75],["^",1,0.75]]],["^",1,0.75]]]]],
  "source": "tome-src-full/data/talents/cunning/artifice.lua:430",
  "note": "Rogue's Brew getStam = combatStatScale(\"cun\",5,50,0.75) + combatTalentScale(t,5,50,0.75)。这里按 Lua 的运算顺序手工展开：Lua 是 m*(x)^p + (low - m*x_low^p)，而 statScale/talentScale 节点是 slope*(x^p - x_low^p) + low；两者代数等价但在两个锚点（tl=1→55、tl=5→100）上浮点结果分别是 54.99999999999999/99.99999999999999，%d 截断成 54/99（导出值），用节点写法会得到整 55/100 而差 1。"
 },
